{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1510462-homebrew-question-how-would-you-price-balance-dragon-king-paths-for-a-solar-exalt","id":1510462,"title":"[Homebrew Question] How would you price/balance Dragon-King paths for a Solar Exalt?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-05-01T20:37:49-07:00","id":1510462,"title":"[Homebrew Question] How would you price/balance Dragon-King paths for a Solar Exalt?","content":"Really wish this forum had a Home-Brew Section:-<br /> <br /> NOTE: All of this is based on <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3559-lanaya\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3559_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3559\" data-vbnamecard=\"3559\">Lanaya</a> 's Dragon-King homebrew see quote at the bottom of this post.<br /> <br /> I am trying to home-brew a new God-Blooded type basically a Dragon-King / Human hybrid who can eventually exalt as a solar .<br /> <br /> I've got a fairly good idea of what I want to do and accomplish using Merits etc (Basically buy things like un-natural hide, Mighty-Thews etc)<br /> <br /> But my one sticking point is how would I price and balance DK-Paths for a Solar Exalt.<br /> <br /> Note: Basically my personal view is that the paths should be more a flavor thing for the Solar rather then a direct boost or something that the Exalt in question can go : <br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Look I am not a Celestial Exalt, I control fire/wind/water/earth etc&quot; before launching a fire-bolt in to the air.</i><br /> <br /> With that as the goal, my basic rule that I want to give my ST (and ask everyone's opinion about is ) :<br /> <br /> 1) DK Paths can not be used at the same instant/action as a Solar Charm (as in you can either use DK Paths on one turn/action or use Solar Charms not both). <br /> <br /> 2) <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3559-lanaya\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar3559_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"3559\" data-vbnamecard=\"3559\">Lanaya</a> priced DK Paths as 8/10 XP (same as Solar charms), I was thinking in a Solar game with the above rule that might be too much. So I was wondering how would you price them? I was going for 4/5 XP but I am unsure.<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/781489-ex3-dragon-kings-homebrew\">Link/Post To Lanaya's Awesome Homwbrew Of My Favorite Dragons below:-</a><br /> --------------------------------------------------<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lanaya</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/781489-ex3-dragon-kings-homebrew#post781489\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wrote up rules for everyone's favourite dinosaur monsters. The document contains all 15 Paths, and should have everything you need to play a Dragon King, but I may have forgotten a few important things. I stuck fairly closely to porting over the old mechanics, but in some cases I've shifted things around and reworked Steps, either to make them fit better into the 3e environment or because I just felt it'd be cooler that way.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1NK47sNjn5B6CxXTKwwhhuetBFGrIvn_h3ikpDdrGjQw/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> <br /> Update: Now containing:<br /> - Mundane gear and artifacts<br /> - Dragon King martial arts<br /> - Rules for <i>Olchilik\u00e9</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4678-tryingtobeslim","name":"TryingToBeSlim","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}